      "general": {
        "abstract": "Hydrometeorological observations within 3 embedded catchments (0.9, 2.6 and 14.5 km2). Mediterranean climate with heavy rainfall and flash floods in automn. The geology is mainly shale. The land use is mainly forest. This site is typical of the Cévennes region. More information at http://www.ohmcv.fr",
